@startuml
title Timing Diagram: Watchdog Timeout (PACKET_LOSS)

robust "Drone 2 State" as D2
concise "Scheduler" as SCH
robust "Watchdog Timer" as WD

@0
D2 is IDLE
SCH is LISTENING
WD is IDLE

@1
SCH is DISPATCHING
SCH -> D2 : UDP [CMD:4:LOW:PACKET_LOSS]
WD is RUNNING : Starts 30s countdown

@2
SCH is LISTENING
D2 is EN_ROUTE : (Silently dropping STATUS packets)

@31
WD is TIMEOUT : 30 seconds elapsed!
WD -> SCH : Trigger Timeout Exception

@32
SCH is HANDLING_TIMEOUT : Marks Drone 2 SOFT_FAULT
WD is IDLE

@33
SCH is FAULT_RECOVERY : Strips fault & Re-queues mission
SCH -> SCH : Dispatch to Drone 1

@34
SCH is LISTENING
@enduml